{"candidate_topics":["contract","provenance"],"canonical_statement":"A classification is a pure function of the statement, the prompt version and the classifier model. Re-running with a different triple appends a new record rather than replacing the old one, so consumers pick the record whose stamps they trust.","content_sha256":"23cb2021cbcf20b7730637945b6225200435b3ce8b44560a91f91a2950949d10","context_note":"The immutability rule that makes the output auditable over time.","created_at":"2026-08-12T11:46:52.191536+00:00","decision":"keep","decontextualization_note":"","drop_reason":null,"entity_mentions":[],"evidence":[{"excerpt":"**Append, never overwrite.** A classification is a pure function of\n`(statement, prompt_version, classifier_model)`.","excerpt_sha256":"061ade2724d6b7f46c7fed5e28f994e0c7770e8ef74dcbae8dc2709d840e4141","excerpt_verified":true,"normalized_char_end":2799,"normalized_char_start":2683,"normalized_line_end":75,"normalized_line_start":74,"normalized_path":"01_normalized/src-specification-bf9781a3/normalized.txt","original_locator_end":{},"original_locator_start":{},"role":"primary","source_id":"src-specification-bf9781a3"}],"extraction_confidence":0.9,"flags":[],"granularity_policy":"molecular-v1","grounding":"attributable","independence_group":"group-src-specification-bf9781a3","modality":null,"model_role":"molecular-extractor","node_kind":"unit","parent_artifacts":["01_normalized/src-specification-bf9781a3/normalized.txt"],"prompt_version":"pass-01-molecular-extraction-v4.2","qualifiers":[],"quantitative":false,"run_id":"spec","schema_version":"3.1.0","scores":{"connection_value":3,"evidence_strength":3,"novelty":2,"retrieval_value":3,"specificity":3},"source_family_id":"family-src-specification-bf9781a3","source_id":"src-specification-bf9781a3","suppressed_modality":null,"unit_id":"u-src-specification-bf9781a3-0005"}
{"candidate_topics":["contract","scope"],"canonical_statement":"The classifier answers what kind of statement something is and never whether it is correct. Epistemic maturity is produced separately as `status`, but truth is not, and neither are relationships between statements.","content_sha256":"2f5ff1948e454e112484e885ec9c920331b8a59230bd619db208b0e22a74afa9","context_note":"The boundary that separates this component from the judgment work done elsewhere in the pipeline.","created_at":"2026-08-12T11:46:52.191880+00:00","decision":"keep","decontextualization_note":"","drop_reason":null,"entity_mentions":[],"evidence":[{"excerpt":"**The classifier does not judge truth.** It answers \"what kind of statement is\nthis\", never \"is this correct\".","excerpt_sha256":"3eddcca44dda8979776d96cc3bf8ba7f60de3b36dec3594f3fce5081670310fb","excerpt_verified":true,"normalized_char_end":3052,"normalized_char_start":2942,"normalized_line_end":80,"normalized_line_start":79,"normalized_path":"01_normalized/src-specification-bf9781a3/normalized.txt","original_locator_end":{},"original_locator_start":{},"role":"primary","source_id":"src-specification-bf9781a3"}],"extraction_confidence":0.9,"flags":[],"granularity_policy":"molecular-v1","grounding":"attributable","independence_group":"group-src-specification-bf9781a3","modality":null,"model_role":"molecular-extractor","node_kind":"unit","parent_artifacts":["01_normalized/src-specification-bf9781a3/normalized.txt"],"prompt_version":"pass-01-molecular-extraction-v4.2","qualifiers":[],"quantitative":false,"run_id":"spec","schema_version":"3.1.0","scores":{"connection_value":3,"evidence_strength":3,"novelty":2,"retrieval_value":3,"specificity":3},"source_family_id":"family-src-specification-bf9781a3","source_id":"src-specification-bf9781a3","suppressed_modality":null,"unit_id":"u-src-specification-bf9781a3-0006"}
